# Publish exclusions. `git archive` (and therefore tool/release.sh and the
# fresh public repo built from it) drops everything marked export-ignore.
# Policy: dated, internal engineering protocols (dev-logs, experiments,
# status hand-overs) stay in this repository's history but never ship;
# only timeless documentation ships (docs/contract/, configuration,
# architecture, sync, usage guide, quickstart). The maintainer's personal
# denylist never ships either. Dated docs/ files match the globs below —
# name new internal notes docs/dev-log-*.md or docs/<YYYY-MM-DD>-*.md.
docs/dev-log-* export-ignore
docs/2026-* export-ignore
docs/experiments/ export-ignore
docs/github-metadata.md export-ignore
tool/release-denylist.txt export-ignore
tool/probe/ export-ignore
